  "description": "Sunkiva – Cute Bold Script Font\nProduct Description\nSunkiva is a cute, bold, and playful script font designed to bring warmth and personality to your creative projects. With its smooth hand-lettered style and adorable heart accent, this font instantly creates a friendly, cheerful, and modern look.\nPerfect for branding, packaging, social media, and merchandise, Sunkiva is crafted to make your designs feel sweet, eye-catching, and memorable. Whether you’re creating a bakery logo, children’s products, beauty branding, greeting cards, or printable designs, Sunkiva adds a charming handmade touch to every project.\nIts bold strokes ensure excellent readability while maintaining a fun and stylish appearance, making it suitable for both digital and print designs.\nPerfect For\nLogos & Branding\nBakery & Cafe Designs\nBeauty & Cosmetic Packaging\nChocolate & Candy Packaging\nKids Brand Identity\nGift Tags & Labels\nGreeting Cards\nT-Shirts\nTote Bags\nMugs\nStickers\nSocial Media Posts\nInstagram Quotes\nFacebook Graphics\nPosters\nInvitations\nScrapbooking\nCricut & Silhouette Projects\nSublimation Designs\nPrintable Products\nCreative Market Templates\nFont Features\nCute Handwritten Script Style\nBold & Easy to Read\nSmooth Curves\nPlayful Character Design\nHeart Accent Detail\nPerfect for Branding\nWorks for Print & Digital Use\nPUA Encoded\nEasy to Install\nCompatible with Windows & macOS\nWhat’s Included\nOTF Font",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sunkiva – Cute Bold Script Font<br>\nProduct Description</p>\n<p>Sunkiva is a cute, bold, and playful script font designed to bring warmth and personality to your creative projects. With its smooth hand-lettered style and adorable heart accent, this font instantly creates a friendly, cheerful, and modern look.</p>\n<p>Perfect for branding, packaging, social media, and merchandise, Sunkiva is crafted to make your designs feel sweet, eye-catching, and memorable. Whether you’re creating a bakery logo, children’s products, beauty branding, greeting cards, or printable designs, Sunkiva adds a charming handmade touch to every project.</p>\n<p>Its bold strokes ensure excellent readability while maintaining a fun and stylish appearance, making it suitable for both digital and print designs.</p>\n<p>Perfect For<br>\nLogos &amp; Branding<br>\nBakery &amp; Cafe Designs<br>\nBeauty &amp; Cosmetic Packaging<br>\nChocolate &amp; Candy Packaging<br>\nKids Brand Identity<br>\nGift Tags &amp; Labels<br>\nGreeting Cards<br>\nT-Shirts<br>\nTote Bags<br>\nMugs<br>\nStickers<br>\nSocial Media Posts<br>\nInstagram Quotes<br>\nFacebook Graphics<br>\nPosters<br>\nInvitations<br>\nScrapbooking<br>\nCricut &amp; Silhouette Projects<br>\nSublimation Designs<br>\nPrintable Products<br>\nCreative Market Templates<br>\nFont Features<br>\nCute Handwritten Script Style<br>\nBold &amp; Easy to Read<br>\nSmooth Curves<br>\nPlayful Character Design<br>\nHeart Accent Detail<br>\nPerfect for Branding<br>\nWorks for Print &amp; Digital Use<br>\nPUA Encoded<br>\nEasy to Install<br>\nCompatible with Windows &amp; macOS<br>\nWhat’s Included<br>\nOTF Font</p>",
